<title>FRANCE: Valeo Q1 sales up 10.8 percent.</title>
<headline>Valeo Q1 sales up 10.8 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 8,235    up  10.8 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Valeo said in a statement that export sales made up 70 percent of the total against 67 percent last year. It added sales in France were up 1.7 percent and exports were 15.2 percent higher.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
